  "releaseNotes": "## v1.7.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v1.6.0:\n\n- refactor: clear the analyzer findings on the binary-detection change ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: validate the binary fixture path instead of letting Path.Combine drop the test directory ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: skip binary files instead of merging them as UTF-8 text [minor] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
